  "description": "**** ENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY********\n\nDNG Leonard and Heaslip are delighted to bring to the rental market these 3 beds semi - detached house located in Oranmore.\n\nBright and spacious throughout, the property offers well-appointed accommodation over two floors. On the ground floor there  separate living room which features double glass doors opening into the open-plan kitchen/dining area which further benefits from an additional separate living area.\nA sperate utility room and a downstairs W.C finishes of the ground floor. Upstairs there are 2 large double bedrooms one of which has an ensuite and a single bedroom which could also be used as home office. The property also benefits from off street carparking.\n\nThe Clochog development is mature development is conveniently located within the village of Oranmore which has a host of numerous amenities such as shops, cafes, bars, restaurants and banking facilities. There are several Montessori, primary and secondary schools close by. The village is served by both public transport and has ease of access to both the M6, M17 & M18 motorways while Galway City Centre is a short commute.\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Leonard & Heaslip has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Leonard & Heaslip accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser 